  <LocalizedText>
	<Text id="LOC_GOLDENAGE_NAME">
		<en_US>[ICON_GLORY_SUPER_GOLDEN_AGE][COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]GoldenAge· Brave New World[ENDCOLOR]</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>[ICON_GLORY_SUPER_GOLDEN_AGE][COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黄金时代·美丽新世界[ENDCOLOR][ICON_GLORY_SUPER_GOLDEN_AGE]</zh_Hans_CN>
		<zh_Hant_HK>[ICON_GLORY_SUPER_GOLDEN_AGE][COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黃金時代·美麗新世界[ENDCOLOR][ICON_GLORY_SUPER_GOLDEN_AGE]</zh_Hant_HK>
	</Text>

	<Text id="LOC_GOLDENAGE_TEASER">
		<en_US>[COLOR:ResFoodLabelCS]Overhauled or tweaked[ENDCOLOR] [COLOR:ResScienceLabelCS]majority of the gameplay contents[ENDCOLOR] in Civilization VI.</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>对[COLOR:ResScienceLabelCS]大量游戏内容与机制[ENDCOLOR]进行[COLOR:ResFoodLabelCS]优化[ENDCOLOR]。</zh_Hans_CN>
		<zh_Hant_HK>對[COLOR:ResScienceLabelCS]大量遊戲內容與機製[ENDCOLOR]進行[COLOR:ResFoodLabelCS]優化[ENDCOLOR]。</zh_Hant_HK>
	</Text>
	
	<Text id="LOC_GOLDENAGE_AUTHOR">
		<en_US>[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]Gold, Flactine, Errt[ENDCOLOR]</en_US>
		<zh_Hans_CN>[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黄小金, 焰色光芒, Errt[ENDCOLOR]</zh_Hans_CN>
		<zh_Hant_HK>[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黃小金, 焰色光芒, Errt[ENDCOLOR]</zh_Hant_HK>
	</Text>
	
	<Text id="LOC_GOLDENAGE_DESCRIPTION">
		<en_US>[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]GoldenAge·Brave New World[ENDCOLOR] is a comprehensive mod that [COLOR:ResProductionLabelCS]overhauls and tweaks[ENDCOLOR] a great deal of gameplay contents:[NEWLINE][ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResCultureLabelCS]Remade[ENDCOLOR] all Civilizations' and Leaders' Unique Abilities, Unique Units, and Unique Infrastructures.[NEWLINE][ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResFaithLabelCS]Modified[ENDCOLOR] the Costs, Effects and Bonuses of most Districts, Buildings, Wonders, Units, Projects, and so on.[NEWLINE][ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResMilitaryLabelCS]Tweaked [ENDCOLOR] Pantheons and Religions/Tech and Civic Tree/Governments and Policy Cards/Governors' Abilities/Terrains, Features and Resources yields/Power Consumption Mechanic and so on.[NEWLINE][ICON_New]Added [COLOR_LIGHTBLUE]“Glorious/Dark Era”[ENDCOLOR] to all Civilizations according to real history.[NEWLINE][ICON_New]Added NEW Unique Abilitiy [COLOR_GREEN]“Regional and Cultural Trait”[ENDCOLOR] to all Civilization.[NEWLINE][ICON_New]Added [COLOR_FLOAT_SCIENCE]“Urban Level Mechanic”[ENDCOLOR] to encourage Tall play.[NEWLINE][ICON_New]Reworked the [COLOR:Happiness]City Happiness Systems[ENDCOLOR].[NEWLINE][ICON_New]Reworked [COLOR_FLOAT_DIPLOMATIC]AI Difficulty[ENDCOLOR]. Strengthened the AI bonuses sharply in every level.[NEWLINE]This however, is just the tip of the iceberg……[NEWLINE]Civilization VI will become a [COLOR:ButtonCS]Brand new Game[ENDCOLOR] with [COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]GoldenAge·Brave New World[ENDCOLOR]!</en_US>		
		<zh_Hans_CN>[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黄金时代·美丽新世界[ENDCOLOR]是一个[COLOR:ResProductionLabelCS]全面修改游戏内容与添加新游戏机制[ENDCOLOR]的集大成模组：[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResCultureLabelCS]重做[ENDCOLOR]全文明与领袖的特色能力/单位/建筑/改良设施；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResFaithLabelCS]调整[ENDCOLOR]大量区域/建筑/奇观/单位/项目等造价成本、属性与功能；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResMilitaryLabelCS]改动[ENDCOLOR]万神殿与宗教信条/科技市政树结构/政体与政策卡/总督能力/耗电机制/地形地貌资源产出等；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]为各文明增加[COLOR_LIGHTBLUE]辉煌/至暗时代[ENDCOLOR]设定；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]全文明新增[COLOR_GREEN]地域与人文特性[ENDCOLOR]；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]引入[COLOR_FLOAT_SCIENCE]城市分级系统[ENDCOLOR]，将精铺玩法加强到与爆铺持平；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]全新的[COLOR:ResCultureLabelCS]魅力[ENDCOLOR]系统；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]重做[COLOR:Happiness]宜居度系统[ENDCOLOR]，细化各级加成；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]重做[COLOR_FLOAT_DIPLOMATIC]AI难度系统[ENDCOLOR]，大幅增加每级难度之间的跨度；[NEWLINE]
		然而，这只是冰山一角……[NEWLINE]
		[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黄金时代·美丽新世界[ENDCOLOR]的改动量与新内容堪比官方大型资料片[COLOR:ResMilitaryLabelCS]“迭起兴衰”和“风云变幻”[ENDCOLOR]，本模组将会使文明6[COLOR_LIGHTBLUE]焕然一新[ENDCOLOR]！</zh_Hans_CN>
		<zh_Hant_HK>[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黃金時代·美麗新世界[ENDCOLOR]是一個[COLOR:ResProductionLabelCS]全面修改遊戲內容與添加新遊戲機製[ENDCOLOR]的集大成模組：[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResCultureLabelCS]重做[ENDCOLOR]全文明與領袖的特色能力/單位/建築/改良設施；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResFaithLabelCS]調整[ENDCOLOR]大量區域/建築/奇觀/單位/項目等造價成本、屬性與功能；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_CheckSuccess][COLOR:ResMilitaryLabelCS]改動[ENDCOLOR]萬神殿與宗教信條/科技市政樹結構/政體與政策卡/行政長官能力/耗電機製/地形地貌資源產出等；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]為各文明增加[COLOR_LIGHTBLUE]輝煌/至暗時代[ENDCOLOR]設定；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]全文明新增[COLOR_GREEN]地域與人文特性[ENDCOLOR]；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]引入[COLOR_FLOAT_SCIENCE]城市分級系統[ENDCOLOR]，將精鋪玩法加強到與爆鋪持平；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]全新的[COLOR:ResCultureLabelCS]魅力[ENDCOLOR]系統；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]重做[COLOR:Happiness]宜居度系統[ENDCOLOR]，細化各級加成；[NEWLINE]
		[ICON_New]重做[COLOR_FLOAT_DIPLOMATIC]AI難度系統[ENDCOLOR]，大幅增加每級難度之間的跨度；[NEWLINE]
		然而，這只是冰山一角……[NEWLINE]
		[COLOR_FLOAT_GOLD]黃金時代·美麗新世界[ENDCOLOR]的改動量與新內容堪比官方大型資料片[COLOR:ResMilitaryLabelCS]「迭起興衰」和「風雲際會」[ENDCOLOR]，本模組將會使文明帝國6[COLOR_LIGHTBLUE]煥然一新[ENDCOLOR]！</zh_Hant_HK>
	</Text>
  </LocalizedText>
</Mod>